The prototype uses fixed light colours on a light panel (\`#f6f7f9\`) so it reads on the dark theme; a module should take theme variables instead. Slot 118 px, row 46 px, box 26 px, margin 118 px a y-level. At 640 px, chapter 3 (5 columns on 2026-11-07, cells wrapped at 3) scrolls horizontally inside its panel.`
